---
layout: default
description: Full-stack product architect. Two decades shipping Rails applications, products, and brands.
page_class: homepage
---

{% featured = collections.projects.resources.select { |project| project.data.group == "featured" }.sort_by { |project| project.data.order }.first(6) %}

<div class="mx-auto w-[min(1180px,calc(100%-2rem))]">
  <section class="grid min-h-[72vh] items-center gap-12 py-20 md:grid-cols-[1.35fr_.65fr] md:py-28">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-5 font-black text-fire">Nikolay Ostrovsky · Product architect</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-[11ch] text-[clamp(3.7rem,10vw,8rem)] font-black leading-[.86] tracking-[-.04em]">Days, not months.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="md:self-end md:pb-5">
      <p class="max-w-[34ch] text-xl leading-relaxed text-muted">I build complex products end to end — architecture, interface, systems, and the business around them.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex gap-8 border-t border-line pt-6">
        <p><strong class="block text-4xl font-black text-fire">20+</strong><span class="text-sm text-muted">years shipping</span></p>
        <p><strong class="block text-4xl font-black text-fire">44</strong><span class="text-sm text-muted">projects archived</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-line py-14 md:py-24">
    <div class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-[-.03em] md:text-6xl">Recent & defining work</h2>
      <a href="/projects/" class="font-black text-ink hover:text-fire">All projects →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% featured.each do |project| %}
        <a href="{{ project.relative_url }}" class="project-card group block">
          <figure class="project-media {{ project.data.logo && 'project-logo' }} aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white">
            <img src="{{ project.data.logo || project.data.cover }}" alt="{{ project.data.name }} project visual" class="h-full w-full object-cover">
          </figure>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-5 border-b border-line py-5">
            <span>
              <strong class="block text-2xl">{{ project.data.name }}</strong>
              <small class="mt-1 block text-muted">{{ project.data.summary }}</small>
            </span>
            <span class="text-fire">↗</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% end %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-10 border-t border-line py-16 md:grid-cols-2 md:py-24">
    <h2 class="max-w-[11ch] text-4xl font-black tracking-[-.03em] md:text-6xl">Architecture × product × design.</h2>
    <div>
      <p class="mb-6 max-w-[55ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">From pharmacy ERP across 1,300+ stores to education platforms in 11 schools and a verified Phuket property marketplace. I work where product decisions and technical decisions are the same decision.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="https://git-wrapped.com/profiles/firedev" class="border border-ink px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black hover:border-fire hover:bg-fire hover:text-white">Git Wrapped ↗</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/firedev" class="border border-ink px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black hover:border-fire hover:bg-fire hover:text-white">GitHub ↗</a>
        <a href="/about/" class="border border-ink px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black hover:border-fire hover:bg-fire hover:text-white">About →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
